(ex1 x1: (x1 <= max $ & 0 <= x1 & ((ex1 x2: (x2 <= x1 & 0 <= x2 & ((ex1 x3: (x3 <= x2 & 0 <= x3 & ((ex1 x4: (x4 <= x3 & 0 <= x4 & ((ex1 x5: (x5 <= x4 & 0 <= x5 & ((x5 in P6)) & (all1 x6: (x6 <= x4 & x5 < x6 => ((x6 in P5))))))) & (all1 x5: (x5 <= x3 & x4 < x5 => ((x5 in P4))))))) & (all1 x4: (x4 <= x2 & x3 < x4 => ((x4 in P3))))))) & (all1 x3: (x3 <= x1 & x2 < x3 => ((x3 in P2))))))) & (all1 x2: (x2 <= max $ & x1 < x2 => ((x2 in P1))))));
